{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow. Adapt. Symbiotize.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Primordial Empire</strong>, a <strong>microscopic RTS</strong> where you build a miniscule empire through symbiosis and evolution in a vibrant world of micro-organisms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/a756208bfb18d59c83c6abf9116c8ebc.poster.avif?t=1770114765\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/a756208bfb18d59c83c6abf9116c8ebc.webm?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/a756208bfb18d59c83c6abf9116c8ebc.mp4?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate </strong>a thriving colony by growing a diverse array of plants and organisms on any solid surface, starting with basic Stem Cells and eventually growing into a diverse ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and manage essential <strong>resources</strong> like protein, minerals, and DNA,<strong> </strong>or <strong>trade </strong>them between colonies if not locally available. Balance resource management and growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your colony and build up your <strong>defence</strong> to protect the budding ecosystem from waves of <strong>hostile invaders</strong>. Sometimes, fighting is your only option.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Encounter</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/eb6c6a679b462ec5105e451d35e12c76.poster.avif?t=1770114765\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/eb6c6a679b462ec5105e451d35e12c76.webm?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/eb6c6a679b462ec5105e451d35e12c76.mp4?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 6 different types of colourful and distinct <strong>biomes</strong>: Lush, Salt Barrens, Caves, Mineralized, Fungal and Hydrothermal. Each biome presents unique challenges and strategic resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to befriend <strong>neutral wildlife </strong>or compete against them, affecting their stances and your colony's strategy. Are they helpful allies or threats to eliminate?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genetic Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/e947fb88ff4c6deb137353a9839f8fe4.poster.avif?t=1770114765\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/e947fb88ff4c6deb137353a9839f8fe4.webm?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/e947fb88ff4c6deb137353a9839f8fe4.mp4?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter new plants and cells in your adventures and add them to your collective. Each of them offers unique <strong>effects and bonuses</strong> for expanding your microscopic empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve</strong> and <strong>adapt</strong> to the ever-changing biomes by unlocking new <strong>genes</strong> for your genome. Only the fittest can survive!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Map Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/bb04611c50fa9f38baef7eb4cc7ba42f.poster.avif?t=1770114765\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/bb04611c50fa9f38baef7eb4cc7ba42f.webm?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/bb04611c50fa9f38baef7eb4cc7ba42f.mp4?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>world map</strong> of <strong>freeplay mode</strong> to explore and dominate the primordial soup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish <strong>trade routes</strong> between your settlements to transfer resources while protecting them from unfriendly entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade hostile areas with your <strong>expeditionary forces</strong>, and remove these foreign threats to secure your own colonies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new areas and discover upgrades and organisms to build a sprawling network of ecosystems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to dive deeper? Wishlist the full game to stay updated and experience Primordial Empire in its entirety!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea