nts unique challenges and strategic resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to befriend <strong>neutral wildlife </strong>or compete against them, affecting their stances and your colony's strategy. Are they helpful allies or threats to eliminate?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genetic Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/e947fb88ff4c6deb137353a9839f8fe4.poster.avif?t=1770114765\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/e947fb88ff4c6deb137353a9839f8fe4.webm?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/e947fb88ff4c6deb137353a9839f8fe4.mp4?t=1770114765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter new plants and cells in your adventures and add them to your collective. Each of them offers unique <strong>effects and bonuses</strong> for expanding your microscopic empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve</strong> and <strong>adapt</strong> to the ever-changing biomes by unlocking new <strong>genes</strong> for your genome. Only the fittest can survive!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Map Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/bb04611c50fa9f38baef7eb4cc7ba42f.poster.avif?t=1770114765\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/bb04611c50fa9f38ba